# The context of the image is the directory above this repository (see the
# Dockerfile): it holds carrel/ and typecase/ side by side — and, on a
# developer's machine, whatever else lies there. BuildKit reads this file,
# named after the Dockerfile, instead of a .dockerignore at the context's
# root, so what goes in is named here and nothing else: the server, the
# client, Typecase. dev/ (credentials) is never in the context.
*
!carrel/carrel/server
!carrel/carrel/client
!typecase

# Of those: no history, no documentation, no test stands.
**/.git
typecase/docs
carrel/carrel/server/testdata
carrel/carrel/client/guard/testdata
